# Copy to .env.local if you ever need one. Never commit .env.local.
# Variables WITHOUT the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix are server-only (route handlers).
#
# Version 1 of the product (see docs/PRODUCT.md) needs NO environment variables:
# there is no backend for health data and no external API.
# Do not add a variable without Alberto's approval.

# Optional: watch connection in the parent's browser (Settings > Watch).
# Public OAuth client ID (Web application) from Google Cloud. It is NOT a secret. Never add a client secret.
# Without it the "Connect watch" button is disabled and "Use demo data" still works.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
